(FOUND)&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;Stopping by to look for this cap was a welcome respite from the driving as I made my way east to SK today.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;Once parked, I saw the cap was a whole 70 m away and after that short jaunt through the park gate and up a tiny hill, there was the cap in a 4 inch deep hole. All it needed was a cleaning off of the grass clippings and some mud and it was ready for the pics.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;Thanks for the cap!&lt;/p&gt;

